# Build context for Dockerfile.borrower (BuildKit picks <Dockerfile>.dockerignore over .dockerignore).
# Only apps/borrower's sources go in; the root package, docs, infra and every node_modules stay out.
*
!apps/borrower
apps/borrower/node_modules
apps/borrower/.next
apps/borrower/test-results
apps/borrower/playwright-report
apps/borrower/tests
apps/borrower/*.tsbuildinfo
apps/borrower/.env*
